Title:  We sat down and wrote it together

Seq:    6.34.1.6

Level:  5 - Detail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[McCartney, Paul|Paul McCartney]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in The Beatles Anthology (Paul)|The Beatles Anthology]]*

Body:

I don’t think “Rain” was just John’s. We sat down and wrote it together. It was John’s vocal and John’s feel on the song, but what gave it its character was collaboration.

